# The Network: NTP
#
# Expects DIRECT.
#
# Time sync should not ride a proxy path. These names sit in the profile's always-real-ip, so the packets themselves reach the gateway by bare address and only the inline UDP 123 rule in the profile catches them; measured as 21,000 NTP flows to Apple's time servers riding the fallthrough proxy in the 14 days to 2026-09-09.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pool.ntp.org
DOMAIN,ntp.aliyun.com
DOMAIN,ntp.ntsc.ac.cn
DOMAIN,ntp.tencent.com
DOMAIN,time.apple.com
DOMAIN,time.google.com
DOMAIN,time.windows.com
DOMAIN,time1.google.com
DOMAIN,time2.google.com
DOMAIN,time3.google.com
DOMAIN,time4.google.com
